  "cues": [
    {"id":"moon","shotId":"moon","text":"今天晚上，很好的月光。","reuseId":"moon-1","section":"一","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/moon.wav"},
    {"id":"dog","shotId":"moon","text":"然而须十分小心。不然，那赵家的狗，何以看我两眼呢？","section":"一","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/dog.wav"},
    {"id":"zhao","shotId":"street","text":"早上小心出门，赵贵翁的眼色便怪：似乎怕我，似乎想害我。","section":"二","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/zhao.wav"},
    {"id":"whisper","shotId":"street","text":"还有七八个人，交头接耳的议论我。又怕我看见。","section":"二","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/whisper.wav"},
    {"id":"smile","shotId":"street","text":"其中最凶的一个人，张着嘴，对我笑了一笑；我便从头直冷到脚跟。","section":"二","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/smile.wav"},
    {"id":"lock","shotId":"door","text":"陈老五赶上前，硬把我拖回家中了。进了书房，便反扣上门，宛然是关了一只鸡鸭。","section":"三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/lock.wav"},
    {"id":"history-a","shotId":"history","text":"我翻开历史一查，这历史没有年代，","reuseId":"history-1","section":"三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/history-a.wav"},
    {"id":"history-b","shotId":"history","text":"歪歪斜斜的每叶上都写着“仁义道德”几个字。","reuseId":"history-2","section":"三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/history-b.wav"},
    {"id":"history-c","shotId":"history","text":"我横竖睡不着，仔细看了半夜，才从字缝里看出字来，满本都写着两个字是“吃人”！","section":"三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/history-c.wav"},
    {"id":"fish","shotId":"meal","text":"陈老五送进饭来，一碗菜，一碗蒸鱼；这鱼的眼睛，白而且硬，张着嘴，同那一伙想吃人的人一样。","section":"四","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/fish.wav"},
    {"id":"brother","shotId":"consult","text":"大哥说：“今天请何先生来，给你诊一诊。”我说：“可以！”","section":"四","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/brother.wav"},
    {"id":"doctor","shotId":"consult","text":"老头子坐着，闭了眼睛，摸了好一会，呆了好一会；便张开他鬼眼睛说：“不要乱想。静静的养几天，就好了。”","section":"四","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/doctor.wav"},
    {"id":"aside","shotId":"aside","text":"老头子跨出门，走不多远，便低声对大哥说道，“赶紧吃罢！”大哥点点头。","section":"四","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/aside.wav"},
    {"id":"question","shotId":"question","text":"从来如此，便对么？","reuseId":"question-1","section":"八","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/question.wav"},
    {"id":"madman-name","shotId":"named","text":"“都出去！疯子有什么好看！”","section":"十","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/madman-name.wav"},
    {"id":"label","shotId":"named","text":"他们岂但不肯改，而且早已布置；预备下一个疯子的名目罩上我。","section":"十","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/label.wav"},
    {"id":"beams","shotId":"beams","text":"横梁和椽子都在头上发抖；抖了一会，就大起来，堆在我身上。","section":"十","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/beams.wav"},
    {"id":"false-weight","shotId":"beams","text":"我晓得他的沉重是假的，便挣扎出来，出了一身汗。","section":"十","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/false-weight.wav"},
    {"id":"self-a","shotId":"self","text":"四千年来时时吃人的地方，","reuseId":"complicity-1","section":"十二","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/self-a.wav"},
    {"id":"self-b","shotId":"self","text":"今天才明白，我也在其中混了多年；","reuseId":"complicity-2","section":"十二","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/self-b.wav"},
    {"id":"children","shotId":"children","text":"没有吃过人的孩子，或者还有？","reuseId":"children-1","section":"十三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/children.wav"},
    {"id":"plea","shotId":"children","text":"救救孩子……","reuseId":"plea-1","section":"十三","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/plea.wav"},
    {"id":"cured","shotId":"epilogue","text":"劳君远道来视，然已早愈，赴某地候补矣。","section":"小序 · 兄长转述","audioFile":"public/madman/voice-v5/cured.wav"}
  ]
}
